    "title": "North Alabama nonprofit offers life-changing scholarships to youth - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah Jones ,\n8 hours ago Extended Family, a nonprofit organization based in Cherokee County, is making strides in supporting families affected by incarceration and at-risk youths through its innovative programs. The organization operates in Cherokee, Calhoun, DeKalb, and Etowah counties, offering the Extended Family for Kids program and the Extended Family Leadership Academy. These initiatives... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
